## Project Overview

This project is a ERC-20 standard token deployed on the Binance Smart Chain (BSC). The contract is implemented based on [OpenZeppelin](https://openzeppelin.com/contracts/) libraries, written in Solidity `v0.8.20`, and developed using [Hardhat](https://hardhat.org/). At present, the repository contains only the token contract.

## Tech Stack

- **Blockchain Network**: Binance Smart Chain (BSC)
- **Contract Language**: Solidity 0.8.20
- **Development Framework**: Hardhat
- **Contract Library**: OpenZeppelin Contracts

## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

1. Install [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/)
2. Clone the repository and install dependencies:

   ```bash
   git clone <repository-url>
   cd <project-directory>
   npm install
   ```

### Compile Contracts

```bash
npx hardhat compile
```

### Deploy Contracts

Set the parameters in `scripts/deploy-cctoken.js` as needed, then run:

```bash
npx hardhat run scripts/deploy-cctoken.ts --network bsc
```

(Adjust deployment scripts and configurations to your needs.)

### Test Contracts

```bash
npx hardhat test
```

## Core Features

- **Token Standard**: ERC-20
- **Secure implementation based on OpenZeppelin**
- **Standard token functions**: transfer, approve, balance query, etc.
- **Blacklist Management**: Addresses can be added to a blacklist; blacklisted addresses are restricted from token operations

